{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914670/extras/497a139619ef84049f4323f9da865163.avif?t=1760324060\" width=616 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set sail on your grandfrog's fishing boat and venture forth into an oceanic paradise rife with magic and teeming with aquatic life. In this demo, cast yourself into the first of 5 unique regions the game has to offer, beginning your journey to uncover the mystery of the ocean's ultimate prize: The Jewel of the Sea!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914670/extras/534391bfec990979978b6696b50d377b.avif?t=1760324060\" width=616 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lean back and enjoy a relaxing fishing experience. This demo will give you the chance to catch 20 fish from our catalog of over 100 unique fish to populate your fishing journal. And even if you don't quite catch something with fins and gills, almost everything has a use, so keep your chin up!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914670/extras/c3aa8882f3b0d320270f8f02a95d123f.avif?t=1760324060\" width=616 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet and befriend a diverse cast of adorable froggy fellows, all with their own unique stories and goals. Listen to their woes and help them out, and they just might help you back. Finding the Jewel of the Sea is no easy task, but with friends by your side you've got nothing to fear!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3914670?t=1760324060","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3914670?t=1760324060","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914670/830640991a9d01b44fba302110fb7ad5fa6a652b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760324060","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914670/830640991a9d01b44fba302110fb7ad5fa6a652b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760324060","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914670/extras/497a139619ef84049f4323f9da865163.avif?t=1760324060\" width=616 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set sail on your grandfrog's fishing boat and venture forth into an oceanic paradise rife with magic and teeming with aquatic life. In this demo, cast yourself into the first of 5 unique regions the game has to offer, beginning your journey to uncover the mystery of the ocean's ultimate prize: The Jewel of the Sea!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914670/extras/534391bfec990979978b6696b50d377b.avif?t=1760324060\" width=616 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lean back and enjoy a relaxing fishing experience. This demo will give you the chance to catch 20 fish from our catalog of over 100 unique fish to populate your fishing journal. And even if you don't quite catch something with fins and gills, almost everything has a use, so keep your chin up!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914670/extras/c3aa8882f3b0d320270f8f02a95d123f.avif?t=1760324060\" width=616 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet and befriend a diverse cast of adorable froggy fellows, all with their own unique stories and goals. Listen to their woes and help them out, and they just might help you back. Finding the Jewel of the Sea is no easy task, but with friends by your side you've got nothing to fear!</p>","developers":["Team Sloop"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3643000","name":"Drizzle"},"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914670/6a24c4ab1c6f9b6a68fae1855cb6a8528e4dd2ef/header.jpg?t=1760324060","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3914670/1472579190/46e34c33669cd5a89ae888d050af4fe17086ac89/1758552920/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760324058","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3914670/1472579190/46e34c33669cd5a89ae888d050af4fe17086ac89/1758552920/dash_h264.mpd?t=1760324058","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3914670/1472579190/46e34c33669cd5a89ae888d050af4fe17086ac89/1758552920/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1760324058","id":257204061,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257204061/movie480.mp4?t=1760324058","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257204061/movie_max.mp4?t=1760324058"},"name":"Gameplay","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257204061/9155b0701ff5328237fa6c0223f0be4bdaf377b1/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1760324058","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/25720